        sqm:'28–40 m²', height:'Full height in dormer zone', planning:'Usually not required',
        desc:'Two bedrooms from a large dormer conversion — ideal for growing families. Shared bathroom between both rooms with private access from the landing.',
        svg: `<svg viewBox="0 0 420 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Poppins,Arial,sans-serif">
